    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/29d228755dd6097370339a66cd993902.poster.avif?t=1744738192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/29d228755dd6097370339a66cd993902.webm?t=1744738192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>It is simple - Calm Cove is a cozy building game and all you do is build your little dream island while soaking in the soothing sounds of nature. No stress, no management, no combat. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/0f8903298ecd9c365f395d1259418857.poster.avif?t=1744738192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/0f8903298ecd9c365f395d1259418857.webm?t=1744738192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Creativity is rewarded - there are countless possibilities for shaping your island. You can even go one step further and decorate the buildings themselves in the way you like!<br><br>Your island comes alive - villagers will settle in and stroll around, because who wouldn't wish to reside on a beautiful island near the ocean?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/e1629fa10d47cb4b7fab6106cda90cbd.poster.avif?t=1744738192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/e1629fa10d47cb4b7fab6106cda90cbd.webm?t=1744738192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/29d228755dd6097370339a66cd993902.poster.avif?t=1744738192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/29d228755dd6097370339a66cd993902.webm?t=1744738192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>It is simple - Calm Cove is a cozy building game and all you do is build your little dream island while soaking in the soothing sounds of nature. No stress, no management, no combat. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/0f8903298ecd9c365f395d1259418857.poster.avif?t=1744738192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/0f8903298ecd9c365f395d1259418857.webm?t=1744738192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Creativity is rewarded - there are countless possibilities for shaping your island. You can even go one step further and decorate the buildings themselves in the way you like!<br><br>Your island comes alive - villagers will settle in and stroll around, because who wouldn't wish to reside on a beautiful island near the ocean?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/e1629fa10d47cb4b7fab6106cda90cbd.poster.avif?t=1744738192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220970/extras/e1629fa10d47cb4b7fab6106cda90cbd.webm?t=1744738192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
